      "text": "1. The Chairman, Railway Board, Ministry of Railways, Rail Bhawan, New Delhi with the\nrequest to relieve the officer immediately to take up his new assignment.\n2. The Secretary, Central Vigilance Commission, Satarkta Bhawan, GPO Complex, Block-\nA, INA, New Delhi-110023.\n3. Shri Ajay Kumar Jaiswal, IRSME(2008) through the Chairman, Railway Board, Ministry\nof Railways.\n4. PS to MOS(PP)/ PSO to Secretary(P)/ PPS to EO/ Dir(SM)/ DS(MM).\n5. AD(OL) for providing Hindi version.\n6. Guard File."
